# 🍁 Maple Harness Configuration

# === Sovereign BYOK Proxy (Optional) ===
# Route all LLM traffic through the local/self-hosted Maple Sovereign Proxy.
# Only the DeepSeek adapter consumes MAPLE_PROXY_URL today; it takes precedence
# over DEEPSEEK_BASE_URL. Proxy authentication is not wired up yet.
# MAPLE_PROXY_URL=http://localhost:8787/v1

# === Direct Provider API Keys (When not using proxy) ===
# DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=sk-...
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-...
